  "ten_axis_comparison": {
    "contour": "Current Castle Mewsha still has crisp outlined flat body/accent silhouettes beside the more painted Roshan, room and dust bunnies. Retained factory/Studio/follower source layers have no new silhouette acceptance; constructed3D presence does not expose their pixels.",
    "material": "Native Castle uses unchanged flat Mewsha next to painted stone/fabric and modeled soft bunnies. R43 painted candidate remains separate and unaccepted; these source-only cases use original art.",
    "palette": "Original companion colors and saves retained. The source Main factory yields three-layer fish/cat/bird resources with the same texture paths/body/line tints. Sampled accent tints differ while _layer_fx runs; source callback binding omits third, but these sequential observations cannot establish accent/pixel invariance.",
    "light": "Authored Canvas scene lighting stays unchanged. Retained battle creates its existing source camera/light; no fixture relight or new production3D source is added. Whole-scene visibility and lighting acceptance remain open.",
    "perspective": "Current 2D hallway card and existing 3D diagnostic trees are separate renderers. No scene reframing or new camera is used to make old art appear; API-only output cannot accept perspective.",
    "scale": "Actual native1280/1600x720 source views retained. This audit does not supply new decoded-alpha fit or device readability approval; R42/R43 fit/candidate evidence retains its original scope.",
    "contact": "Unchanged original Mewsha feet/card contact in the painted Castle remains weak beside Roshan and floor-neighbor bunnies. Hidden battle/Studio actors cannot receive contact approval from constructor positions.",
    "occlusion": "First inspected battle API frames show the battle HUD over the courtyard while its 3D arena is occluded by the still-visible SkyLagoonCanvasLayer. Studio source tree is constructed while the Castle stays visible. Camera/current and visible flags do not alone establish pixel visibility.",
    "readability": "Battle instruction text appears over an unrelated courtyard in the forced API diagnostic. This is a retained API composition defect, not proof of a reachable child route or a new regression. Castle Mewsha keeps the earlier flat/painted style mismatch.",
    "action_state": "Actual source-owner entry, guarded care menu, Hall/exit, forced battle wait/cancel, forced Studio build/free, six Main factory inputs and private SaveState reload are recorded. Natural routes, battle action, full care, follower navigation/motion, QA11, device, child and owner lanes remain open."
